{
  "uid": "fixture2030-monitoreo",
  "title": "Fixture 2030 — 1. Resumen y SLAs",
  "description": "Página de inicio: salud de las cinco bases y de los targets, alertas activas y validación de los SLAs del enunciado (latencia < 100 ms, disponibilidad 99,99 %).",
  "tags": [
    "fixture2030",
    "hito13"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Dashboards del Fixture 2030",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "fixture2030"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Estado de salud",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Estado de salud por base",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (base) (probe_success{job=\"salud-bases\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{base}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CAÍDA",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Sonda del blackbox-exporter contra el puerto publicado de cada base: TCP para MongoDB, Redis y Cassandra; HTTP para Neo4j (7474) e InfluxDB (/health).",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Métricas internas (4. Bases por dentro)",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-bases?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Targets arriba",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(up)",
          "legendFormat": "arriba"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "count(up)",
          "legendFormat": "total"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Estado por target (up)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{base}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CAÍDO",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "1 = Prometheus pudo scrapear el target en el último intervalo; 0 = caído. Cuando se agreguen exporters de las bases o la API, aparecen acá solos.",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Duración del scrape (5. Infraestructura)",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-infraestructura?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "title": "Alertas activas",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "description": "Reglas de prometheus/reglas-o-alertas.yml que están en pending (condición cumplida, esperando el 'for') o firing. Vacío = sin alertas.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "includeByName": {
              "alertname": true,
              "alertstate": true,
              "severidad": true,
              "base": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "alertname": "alerta",
              "alertstate": "estado",
              "severidad": "severidad",
              "base": "base",
              "job": "job"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "estado"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "firing": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "FIRING"
                      },
                      "pending": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "text": "pending"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "SLAs del enunciado: latencia < 100 ms y disponibilidad 99,99 %",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "p95 de la API (SLA < 100 ms)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(fixture2030_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "p95 de todas las requests de la API en los últimos 5 minutos (Q3 sin separar por ruta). Verde por debajo de 100 ms, rojo desde 100 ms. Sin tráfico en la ventana no hay valor (No data).",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "2. API integrada",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-api?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "title": "Requests en < 100 ms (SLA 99,99 %)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 5,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(fixture2030_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{le=\"0.1\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(fixture2030_http_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "< 100 ms"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Disponibilidad efectiva del Hito 3: proporción de requests respondidas dentro del objetivo de 100 ms (bucket le=0.1 del histograma de la API), ventana de 5 minutos. Verde desde 99,99 %. Sin tráfico en la ventana no hay valor.",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "2. API integrada",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-api?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "title": "API sin 5xx (SLA 99,99 %)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 11,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - (sum(increase(fixture2030_http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(increase(fixture2030_http_requests_total[$__range])), 1e-9))",
          "legendFormat": "sin 5xx"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Disponibilidad de la API vista por el usuario: porcentaje de respuestas que no fueron 5xx sobre todo el rango de tiempo elegido arriba a la derecha. Verde desde 99,99 %. Si la API no atendió ninguna request en el rango marca 100 %: mirar 'Requests por segundo' en 2. API integrada.",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "2. API integrada",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-api?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "title": "Disponibilidad de cada base (SLA 99,99 %)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * avg by (base) (avg_over_time(probe_success{job=\"salud-bases\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{base}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Porcentaje de sondas exitosas de cada base (Q1) sobre todo el rango de tiempo elegido arriba a la derecha. Verde desde 99,99 %. Es disponibilidad de la base vista desde la red: que el puerto o /health responda no garantiza que las consultas funcionen.",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "4. Bases por dentro",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-bases?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "title": "Latencia p95 de la API frente al SLA de 100 ms",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-fixture2030"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95 de la API",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(fixture2030_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "Misma consulta que 'Latencia p95 por ruta' (Q3) sin separar por ruta. Línea roja: 100 ms, objetivo de latencia del enunciado (Hito 2). La alerta ApiLatenciaAlta salta recién a 150 ms sostenidos: esta línea es el SLA, aquella el aviso de degradación.",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Detalle por ruta (2. API integrada)",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-api?${__url_time_range}"
        },
        {
          "title": "¿API o base? (3. Comparación entre bases)",
          "url": "/d/fixture2030-comparacion-bases?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
